{
 "duration": 74.998,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Last night, I woke up at three A.M. to the sound of my own voice whispering to me from inside my closet.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.75
  },
  {
   "text": "At first, I thought I was just having sleep paralysis.",
   "start": 7.12,
   "end": 10.5
  },
  {
   "text": "I lay frozen under my covers, staring at the crack in the closet door, waiting for my eyes to adjust to the dark.",
   "start": 10.72,
   "end": 17.83
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, the voice spoke again. It was my exact pitch, my exact breathing... begging me not to make a sound.",
   "start": 17.9,
   "end": 26.98
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Whatever you do,\" it whispered from the shadows, \"do not look at the foot of your bed.\"",
   "start": 27.38,
   "end": 33.14
  },
  {
   "text": "My heart stopped. Slowly, without moving my head, I shifted my eyes downward.",
   "start": 33.675,
   "end": 39.75
  },
  {
   "text": "Standing at the end of my mattress was a tall, pale figure wearing my exact pajamas.",
   "start": 40.155,
   "end": 45.97
  },
  {
   "text": "It had my face, my hair... everything. Except its eyes were completely pitch black, and its smile stretched way too wide.",
   "start": 46.315,
   "end": 55.82
  },
  {
   "text": "It leaned forward, resting its hands on my blankets, and spoke in a cold, hollow voice.",
   "start": 56.086,
   "end": 62.19
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Why are you listening to the thing in the closet?\"",
   "start": 62.606,
   "end": 65.14
  },
  {
   "text": "I didn't have time to scream... because the closet door slowly creaked open behind it.",
   "start": 65.662,
   "end": 72.23
  }
 ],
